timer->it_interval = ns_to_ktime(timer->it.cpu.incr);
```
Reason:
This statement initializes `timer->it_interval` with the value of `timer->it.cpu.incr` during the CPU timer setup. By doing so, it ensures that the common rearm code can correctly check the interval, preventing the unintended behavior of single-shot timers remaining armed when they should not be.

